window.products.push({"id":495053,"name":"EASTVALLEY Powerful Magnetic Knife Strip or Magnetic Knife Holder Kitchen Wall Mount Rack for Knives,Garage & Workshop Tools Wall Rack: Includes Remov","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qMtpOeUoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We are pleased to introduce a new development by EASTVALLEY - the Magnetic Knife Holder. Durable 18\" stainless steel knife strip can hold up to 9 knives and 5 utensils simultaneously; strong magnets will firmly hold the knives and prevent them from falling, thus protecting your kitchen counter from damage. It can hold big knives as chef, cleaver, boning, breadcand small as steak, paring or vegetable knife. From now on, you won't have to look for your appliances in cupboards and cabinets; everything will be in one place.  5 REMOVABLE HOOKS (sliding) will serve as additional holders for kitchen utensils, tools and gadgets. Wall mounted knife strip excellent solution for storing your kitchen inventory.  Magnetic Wall Rack may be used both in the kitchen and office, workshop, or garage for tools. You no longer need to store your knives and appliances in different cabinets and cupboards - now everything will be in one place with an incredibly stylish appearance. The holder is easily fixed to the wall with two screws.  Upgraded Magnets - Avoid trying weak & unsecured magnetic knife holders! Our NEW magnetic knife holder now includes 2 separate lines of HEAVY-DUTY MAGNETS.  We tested dozens of different knives to make 100% sure our customers will be satisfied. Our bar will safely hold the largest, heaviest of your knives to the smallest and skinniest ones, Chef's knives, Butcher knives, Cleavers, Bread knives and ANY other Kitchen knife you may have. ***OUR GUARANTEE*** Our magnetic knife bar is made to the highest standards, that's why we offer a 30 DAY MONEY BACK GUARANTEE!  So what are you waiting for? Keep all your knives visible and within reach! Easily grab the proper knife and get to cooking!  Just click on the 'Add to Cart' button and get yours today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qMtpOeUoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EASTVALLEY","source_asin":"B073XZZRSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-495053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073XZZRSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073XZZRSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":495054,"name":"German Shepherd Dog Themed Etched 12.75oz Wine Glass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c3fc+jlaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This German Shepherd wine glass is a unique and stylish way to enjoy your favorite vintage. This type of wine glass is specially designed to feature the beloved breed of dog, the German Shepherd. The glass typically has a sleek and elegant design with a stem and a rounded bowl, which is perfect for swirling and aerating your wine. The stem of this glass has a tapered shape, which allows for a comfortable and secure grip. The base of this glass is wider than the top to ensure stability and prevent tipping. The bowl of the glass is usually large enough to hold a standard pour of wine, but not so large as to make the glass cumbersome or heavy. What sets the German Shepherd wine glass apart from other wine glasses is the beautifully etched image of a German Shepherd that is usually featured on the side of the glass. The image is intricate and detailed, featuring the iconic long snout and perked ears of the breed. The German Shepherd wine glass is made of high-quality glass, which is designed to enhance the flavors and aromas of your wine. The glass is also durable and dishwasher safe, making it easy to clean and maintain. This type of wine glass is a perfect gift for any German Shepherd lover or wine enthusiast. It can also be used as a decorative item, especially when paired with other German Shepherd themed items. Overall, the German Shepherd wine glass is a stylish and functional addition to any wine lover's collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c3fc+jlaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Etched Laser Art","source_asin":"B00VFJDYGC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-495054","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VFJDYGC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VFJDYGC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":495055,"name":"OwnMy 4 in 1 Candle Accessory Set - Candle Wick Trimmer, Candle Wick Dipper, Candle Wick Snuffer, Storage Tray Plate, Candle Care Tools Gift for Candl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nr2GZX7XL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Description: Made of high-grade stainless steel and professionally produced & painted, this candle accessory set would be a creative and meaningful choice for candle lovers.◀Multi-function candle protector:☑The Candle Wick Trimmer: Used to trim the black wick to prevent it from being too long. It will help the candle root to avoid breaking and not affect next burning, then prolongs its using life.Please notice that the candlewick should be trimmed in a soft and oily state.☑Candle Wick Dipper: Press the burning candle core into the wax oil and dip it, then center the candle core to facilitate the next ignition. It could also adjust the flame position to allow the candle to burn evenly.If we blow out the candle directly with mouth, it will produce a lot of black smoke. But this dipper will help to solve this problem, maintain the candlewick and prevent wick smoldering.☑Candle Wick Snuffer: Just cover the candle to extinguish the flame to cut off the oxygen to the flame. Its rotating design and non-hot handle ensures that we could extinguish candles safely and conveniently, helps to disperse odors and black smoke, prevent hot wax splashes.◀With excellent design and practical functions, this candle accessory set could help keep your desktop tidy while using candle; and also could be used as a beautiful ornament when not in use.◀As wonderful gift at Valentine’s Day, anniversary, wedding, birthday, Christmas, party, candlelight dinner, celebration ceremonies, etc. To bring each candle lover friend with a best gift! Specification: Material: Stainless steelColor: BlackSize:Candle wick trimmer: 7.3”Candle wick dipper: 7.9”Candle wick snuffer: 8.9”; cover diameter: 1.3”Storage tray plate: 9.1”x 3.7”Weight: 350g Package included: 1*Candle Wick Trimmer; 1*Candle Wick Dipper; 1*Candle Wick Snuffer; 1*Storage Tray Plate (The candle is not included!)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nr2GZX7XL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OwnMy","source_asin":"B07YFC7CWH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-495055","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YFC7CWH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YFC7CWH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":495056,"name":"Bambooee Reusable Bamboo Towel (4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hyh9H5ECL._AC_SL1362_.jpg","description":"The Bambooee Perforated Bamboo Towels are the new reusable paper towel alternative to hit the market. These bamboo towels have the same look and feel as ordinary paper towels - they even come in a roll, mimicking how paper towels are normally consumed. The big difference, though, is that you don't just tear a sheet and throw it away. Instead, each sheet of bamboo towel is machine washable and reusable. In fact, when you purchase a roll of 20 Bambooee sheets, it replaces up to 60 paper towel rolls, helping you reduce waste and save money. Rayon made from a sustainibly sourced certified organic bamboo. Bambooee Towels are also strong, absorbent and durable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hyh9H5ECL._AC_SL1362_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bambooee","source_asin":"B00I1MSSVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-495056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I1MSSVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I1MSSVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
