window.products.push({"id":495305,"name":"Virabit French Country Dining Chairs Set of 2, Vintage Louis Chairs with Curved Backrest and Beautifully Carved Solid Wood Frame Farmhouse Dining Chai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71312fuh1VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【French country dining chairs】The antique and old-style rubber wood frame and the simple tones of the seat cushion are so appropriate that the elegant and rustic French country atmosphere is radiated from the carefully carved wooden lines and tufted fabrics. Elegant curves and comfortable touch are integrated, suitable for homes with various decoration styles 【High-quality materials】The backrest and chair legs are made of sturdy rubber wood, ensuring the stability of the French bistro chairs structure. For many years, rubber wood legs have always provided good support. The high-quality tufted fabric is delicate and soft, and the seat cushion filled with high-density sponge is not easy to deform and comfortable, even if you sit for a long time, you can enjoy the highest quality sitting feeling 【Widely applicable】Upholstered dining chairs not only has good decoration, but also has good practicability. It is very suitable for dining room, living room, bedroom, study and other scenes. Whether it’s dining, chatting, resting or reading, Virabit farmhouse dining chairs can accompany your life well. 【Sturdy and easy to install】Retro dining chairs have a simple and sturdy structure and can withstand a weight of more than 300 pounds. Installation guides, installation tools and accessories are included in the package. It only takes a few minutes to complete the installation easily. The foot pads on each chair leg prevent abrasion on the wooden floor or tiled floor. 【After-sales Service】We provide two years warranty and free return for quality problem, if you are unsatisfied with our product, please feel free to contact us and we will reply within 24 hours.We will give you the best service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71312fuh1VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Virabit","source_asin":"B0B5N1Q3KV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-495305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5N1Q3KV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5N1Q3KV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":495306,"name":"Washington DC Street Map B&W by Michael Tompsett, White Matte, Silver Frame 16x20-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kb6nLwQVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, matted framed art piece features a watercolor map of the streets of Washington DC. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs. An 11x14 giclee print under acrylic in a 16x20 silver frame. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating museum quality fine art reproductions. This high quality print is matted using antique white matting and comes in a silver frame. A clear acrylic facing is added to protect the print. The piece is fully assembled by professional framers and comes ready to hang. The antique white mat allows the image to really stand out, making it a great addition to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kb6nLwQVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B01NALLZVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-495306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NALLZVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NALLZVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
