window.products.push({"id":495470,"name":"Howard Miller Westbrook Wall Clock 625-281 – Oak Yorkshire Home Decor with Wood Pendulum, Brass Bob with Quartz, Dual-Chime Movement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":599.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718SJTkqG4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WALL CLOCK: This Westbrook Wall Clock features an Oak Yorkshire finish on select hardwoods and veneers to compliment your home decor. The decorative model includes rounded corners on a fully molded base, flared molded bonnet, and a brass-finished bob on a wooden pendulum. DURABLE: The wooden frame will relieve stress in a busy household. Hang it in the kitchen, office, or living room as it features Arabic numerals, decorative corner accents, serpentine hands, and glass crystal to stand out over the lambs-wool dial. CHIMES: Easily tell time with dual-chime movement that plays Westminster or Ave Maria chime to strike each hour with an option to play on ¼, ½, and ¾ as well. Set the automatic nighttime chime shut-off for convenient volume control to have anywhere in your house. DIMENSIONS: The height is 21.5 inches (54 cm), with a width of 13 inches (33 cm) and a depth of 6.5 inches (16 cm). It is powered by quartz, dual-chime movement and requires two C sized batteries (not included). Made in the USA. HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world’s leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718SJTkqG4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B000FUNR3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-495470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000FUNR3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000FUNR3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
