window.products.push({"id":495637,"name":"Bar Soap Holder - Powerful Vacuum Suction Cup with Loose Suction Warning Indicator - Strong Stainless Steel Sponge Dish Holder for Bathroom & Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71COFag2Y5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The perfect accessory for your bathroom and kitchen! Our unique soap holder comes in quality, innovative, and simple that is unavailable from competing products: • Keep bar soap, sponges, loofahs and other bathroom AND kitchen items within arm's reach with our versatile suction cup soap dish! • Cleaning your bathroom is annoying, but it's even worse when you're in the shower or bathtub and there are slimy soap rings and puddles in the corners because you don't have anywhere to put your soap. Well now you can add a removable soap dish to your bathroom, kitchen, or anywhere else you need convenient organization. • Super Strong Vacuum Suction, Ultimate Convenience Backed by a non-slip suction cup, our grated soap dish lets you put your soaps, razors and other items up near shoulder level for easy convenience, but also allows for water and residue to drain naturally. • Adhering firmly to tile, glass and other non-porous surface, simply press the suction cup where you want to mount the holder and then assemble the basket and screw down cap. It's that easy. No tools, no installation, just versatile convenience. • Long-Lasting Durability. It is made from rust-proof stainless steel coated with polished chrome to give you bathroom décor that's not only useful and beautiful, but that stands the test of time. Have the powerful suction cup soap dish holder with suction warning indicator and never see your soap on your floor due to poor vacuum suction again! Click “Add to Cart” right now and order yours today! Please share a photo with us and everyone on how you use our Soap Bar Dish Holder and your experience with it in the review below. Thank You.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71COFag2Y5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Harmoni","source_asin":"B07BJN7SGH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-495637","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BJN7SGH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BJN7SGH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
