window.products.push({"id":495739,"name":"PackIt Freezable Rolltop Lunch Bag, Shauna Stripe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PA2sAmd0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A new twist on the classic brown lunch bag shape, the Freezable Roll top Lunch Bag brings PackIt's patented cooling technology to a rugged silhouette. Take dairy, deli meats, fresh fruit and veggies anywhere and chill them like a fridge. The secret is freezable gel built into the walls of the cooler. To use, simply flatten the entire bag and place it in the freezer overnight (12 hours). In the morning, the walls of the bag will be completely frozen and ready to chill food and drinks for hours. You'll never waste money on bulky gel packs or mess with leaky ice baggies again. The Freezable Roll top Lunch Bag features a top-load design that's easy to use and makes it simple to pack boxy food containers. The roll top opening and secure buckle lock in cool air, keeping food chilled for hours. Perfect for work, the bag's slim profile takes up minimal space in backpacks and other bags on the ride home. It's also great for chilling water bottles for sports and travel. The rugged material makes it more resistant to wear and tear over time. This soft sided Lunch Bag is made from nontoxic gel and gel liner. Like all PackIt products, the Roll Top Lunch bag is made from PVC free, BPA free, phthalate, and lead free (UL #B80321985, 12/5/2019) materials. The Freezable Roll top Lunch Bag measures 10.75 inches tall, 8.25 inches wide and 5.5 inches deep while open. When flattened, it measures 2 inches tall, 8.25 inches wide and 10.75 inches long for easy storage in the freezer. Cleaning is easy: wipe thoroughly or hand wash the interior and spot clean the exterior; allow bag to dry completely before freezing. Not machine or dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PA2sAmd0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PackIt","source_asin":"B0188I03G6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-495739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0188I03G6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0188I03G6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
