window.products.push({"id":495783,"name":"CounterArt Cotton Boll Heart & Home 3mm Heat Tolerant Tempered Glass Cutting Board 15\" x 12\" Made in the USA Dishwasher Safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W38EUHtfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CounterArt Cotton Boll Heart and Home 3mm Heat Tolerant Tempered Glass Cutting Board. Manufactured in the USA in our Springfield TN facility. Great for food preparation, cutting and serving. Made of high quality 3mm Tempered Glass that is safe for temperatures up to 400 degrees F or 204 degrees C. Measures 15\" x 12\". Non-Skid Rubber Feet included on back of the board to prevent movement of the board when in use. Protects your surfaces from scratches and stains when preparing food. Artistic design allows the Cutting Board to remain displayed when not in use. Adds color and distinction to your space. Cutting Board is dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81W38EUHtfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Counterart","source_asin":"B078J69PNS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-495783","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078J69PNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078J69PNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":495784,"name":"Crzoe Electric Fireplace, Recessed and Wall Mounted Fireplace Heater with Remote Control, Timer, Adjustable Flame Color and Speed, 750w/1500w Electric","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":379.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ys9UzjgoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Energy-saving Design】 Featuring 2 heat settings (750W/1500W), the output heat of this fireplace heater could be adjusted according to the temperature, which can heat up to 400 sq.ft. The Heat comes out of the upper front, which concentrates more heat, avoiding the waste of excess electricity. Meanwhile, you can choose the flame-only/heat-only mode to let it be a great decor at any time. 【Realistic & Ornamental Flame Present】Adopting large tempered glass display and LED light technology, this fireplace simulates real flame effect. Plus, featuring crystal decorative flame bed instead of the common ember beds in the market, our modern electric fireplace instantly adds warmth and elegance to any room. 【Remote & Touch Control Available】 Besides the touch screen panel, it comes up with a remote control that you can operate the electric fireplace within 20 ft. So you can easily adjust the 12 full-spectrum LED colors, and flame speed & brightness in 5 optional modes. The 8H timer function is available for more convenience. 【Safe & Eco-friendly】 Compare with the traditional fireplace, our ETL certificated electric fireplace requiring no gas or oil is smokeless and ash-less. The overheat protection system will shut off the heater automatically if it is overheating. 【Easy Installation & Modern Appearance】 Our Electric Fireplace not only could be recessed or semi recessed in wall, but also can be Wall Mounted. The sleek look and minimalist style make the unit to coordinate with your decor well, ideal for home, office, or anywhere heat and ambiance is needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ys9UzjgoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crzoe","source_asin":"B09GVKQQW2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-495784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GVKQQW2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GVKQQW2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
