window.products.push({"id":495888,"name":"L LOVSOUL Goose Down Comforter King Size All Season Comforter Duvet Insert Soft and Comfortable Medium Warm Down Comforter 100% Egyptian Cotton -with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wVygZpdTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[All-Season Down Comforter]Our comforter has just the right amount of thickness and suitable warm for year-round comfort,For people who like to sweat when sleeping, this quilt is indeed a good choice.Available in your choice of King size 106\" x 90\", Queen size 90\" x 90\". [High-quality Filling]Our duvets are filled with high-quality 75% down, which keeps the duvets high in softness and temperature at all times.The fillings of our works are professionally selected,cleaned and disinfected. The down and feather materials we choose are tasteless and light.and the filling have all passed the RDS DOWNPASS and OEKO-TEX Professional Certification.So you can use it with confidence. [Super soft and breathable cotton fabric]Down Feather Comforter fabric cover is made of 100% Checkered Jacquard Cotton Fabric,safety certified by OEKO-TEX Standard 100,ultra-soft,breathable and quiet. [Scientific Structure Design]The high-quality baffle box stitching technology fixes the goose down in place, Provide maximum fluffy,distributes the down evenly, and double-needle stitching technology prevents goose down moving position provides you with maximum warmth. The exquisite lining design and with 8 corner loops allow you to easily add a duvet cover to hold the quilt in place.Exquisite edging is a down comforter that lasts patiently. [Warm Tips]Our down commforter are vacuum-packed and may have the smell of down.This is a normal smell.After receiving, you only need to take them out of the package, gently loosen them, and put them in a cool and ventilated place and wait for a few hours for the smell Then disappear,or tumble in the dryer for 10 minutes at low temperature at first time use.Dry cleaning with low heat when necessary.We promise to provide good customer service.If you have any questions,feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wVygZpdTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"L LOVSOUL","source_asin":"B0BFWXPK9S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-495888","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFWXPK9S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFWXPK9S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
