window.products.push({"id":495915,"name":"Comfort Zone CZ470BBO 750/1,500-Watt Retro Design Ceramic Heater, Adjustable Thermostat, 2 Heat Settings, Overheat Protection, Safety Tip-Over Switch,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OQtM4HBSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"On the lookout or a stylish heater you can display in your room? Keeping your place warm and cozy is crucial during the winter season. A warm space is not only comfortable, but it also helps get your blood flowing, allowing us to be more productive throughout the day. However, most heaters can look dull, if not unsightly. Plus, many are too bulky to move or bring around. Thankfully, there are portable heating devices that combine functionality with style! Relax in a warm and comforting space with the Comfort Zone Retro Design Small Ceramic Heater! Make sure you're always ready to face even the frostiest climates. This compact ceramic heater is equipped with an adjustable thermostat and 2 heat settings, so you can keep your place warm and comfortable throughout the cold seasons. It even has a fan-only setting for times when you just need to circulate the air in your rooms. Encased in a metal housing with molded handles, this heater is designed to stay cool even while you're using it. Each one features a safety tip-over switch, so it automatically turns off when it gets tipped over. It also boasts an overheat protection system that keeps it from reaching extreme temperatures. More than the functionality it offers, this cute heater also makes for a charming addition to your space. Choose from our burnt orange and black heaters to spruce up your rooms. Each one flaunts a unique retro-modern design that will look great in any bedroom, living room, kitchen, or dining area! Still not convinced? Here are more reasons you should get this heater: - ETL approved for the U.S. and Canada - Long, 6 ft. polarized power cord - Thoughtful housewarming gift for friends and family Heat up your room in style. Add the Comfort Zone Retro Design Small Ceramic Heater to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OQtM4HBSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfort Zone","source_asin":"B0BF1VQ4K6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-495915","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF1VQ4K6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF1VQ4K6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
