window.products.push({"id":495992,"name":"Personalized Galaxy Horse Pattern Fleece Throw Blanket - Blankets with Horses for Girls Kids Winter Warmth Bedding Saddle Up (Adult 60\"x80\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810pwsDd5yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERSONALIZED – Create a truly unique and one-of-a-kind fleece throw blanket for yourself or someone you love. Use the customizing tool to enter your name, their name, a funny saying, or an inside joke. Whatever you choose, we will take your desired text and create an exclusive product just for you that will ship in three business days or less. You’ll be snuggled up in no time! SO SNUGGLY – No matter the design or size, these blankets are sure to keep you and your loved ones warm on the coldest days and nights. Perfect for an afternoon on the couch watching a game or movie, taking on a road trip for a quick snooze in the backseat, or keeping warm at the tailgate party. This blanket goes where you go, and keeps you warm and cozy while you’re there. SIZE OPTIONS – With our three different size blankets to choose from, there is something for everyone. The smallest blanket is 30”x40” and is perfect for small children and almost all pets (sorry horses). The 50”x60” blanket is great for young kids who want to show their unique personality with a bit of personalized fun. The 60”x80” blanket is just huge, excellent for any adults or children who love to ensconce themselves in fleece on their way to Sleepy Town, USA. WASHABLE – Nothing lasts forever, including a clean blanket. One day you’re going to have to wash it, and that’s ok! All blanket sizes are made from 100% washable fleece, and the best part is the custom image will never fade. Because we use premium dye-sublimation materials in the production process, you can be sure that not only will the material last a lifetime, but the custom print will as well. After you wash it, you can also put it in the dryer worry free. Soft and warm, but durable. GREAT GIFT - Trying to find the perfect gift can be stressful, so just relax and personalize this blanket, you’ve found the precise present they’re going to love. A custom gift shows how much you care, that you took the time and effort necessary to make something unique for that special someone. They don’t have to know it was a super easy process that took less than one minute, we’ll keep it our little secret!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810pwsDd5yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personalized Corner","source_asin":"B07HYD3776","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-495992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HYD3776","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HYD3776","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":495993,"name":"Rowenta TO-818 2-Slice Toaster, Carbon Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512KW44PSCL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description This is definitely a 21st century toaster. With its many practical and well thought out features (like the bread warming platform for croissants, burger buns etc.), and its sleek stainless finish and fashion forward design, this is not your mother's toaster! Amazon.com Bagel lovers will appreciate the extra-wide, extra-deep slots on this two-slice toaster. In addition, when the bagel setting is selected, the toaster browns only the cut side of the bagel, heating the rest of it but leaving it moist and chewy. Another ingenious feature is the metal nonstick warming platform on top of the toaster; bread or pastries laid here horizontally warm through without toasting. Sleek and handsome in design, the toaster features cool-touch sides, an ultra-high lift for removing small items, and a removable crumb tray for catching those loose bits of crust and raisins. Seven browning settings toast everything from iced pastries to dense homemade bread, and the defrost setting automatically adjusts to brown frozen slices. The stop/eject button lets the impatient and hungry grab toast to go. A one-year warranty covers the toaster against defects. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512KW44PSCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rowenta","source_asin":"B00006JL0W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-495993","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00006JL0W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00006JL0W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
